commands.command:
/usr/bin/zsh -lc "cat > index.html <<'EOF'
<"'!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#173f49">
  <meta name="description" content="A quiet study. An independent film practice.">
  <title>A quiet study. — Independent film practice</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --ink: #173f49;
      --paper: #f3f0e7;
      --space: clamp(1.5rem, 4.5vw, 5rem);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .skip-link { position: absolute; z-index: 5; left: var(--space); top: 1rem; padding: 1rem; background: var(--paper); transform: translateY(-200%); }
    .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #f1b85b; outline-offset: 6px; }
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 46rem;
      min-height: max(46rem, 100svh);
      padding: var(--space);
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--paper);
      background: var(--ink);
    }
    .hero__poster, .hero::after { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
    .hero__poster { z-index: -2; object-fit: cover; object-position: 75% center; }
    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      z-index: -1;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8, 29, 34, .28), transparent 35%, rgba(8, 29, 34, .72)), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 29, 34, .25), transparent 70%);
    }
    .hero__top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(243, 240, 231, .5); padding-top: 1.25rem; }
    .hero__intro { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(.875rem, 1.2vw, 1rem); line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .015em; }
    .frame-mark { display: block; width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid currentColor; position: relative; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .frame-mark::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 4px; border: 1px solid currentColor; }
    .hero__bottom { padding-top: 12rem; }
    .hero__composition { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2.5rem; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 -.035em -.045em; max-width: 9em; font-family: Georgia, '"'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(4rem, 10.5vw, 10rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
    h1 span { display: block; }
    .explore {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 7.5rem;
      height: 7.5rem;
      padding: 1.15rem;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: .875rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--paper);
      border-radius: 0;
    }
    .explore svg { width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; align-self: flex-end; }
    .explore:hover { background: #f1b85b; border-color: #f1b85b; }
    .hero__caption { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(243, 240, 231, .4); font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .025em; }
    .hero__caption::before { content: \"\"; width: .3rem; height: .3rem; background: currentColor; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .work { padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem) var(--space); scroll-margin-top: 1rem; }
    .work__heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 63, 73, .3); }
    .work__index { font-size: .75rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
    .work__note { margin: 1.5rem 0 0; max-width: 32rem; font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero { min-height: max(42rem, 100svh); }
      .hero__poster { object-position: 75% center; }
      .hero__composition { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 16vw, 6rem); }
      .explore { width: 6rem; height: 6rem; padding: .85rem; }
      .hero__bottom { padding-top: 10rem; }
      .hero__caption { margin-top: 2rem; }
    }
    @media (max-height: 500px) and (min-width: 601px) {
      .hero { min-height: 32rem; }
      .hero__bottom { padding-top: 5rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 6rem); }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#work\">Skip to selected work</a>
  <main>
    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">
      <img class=\"hero__poster\" src=\"assets/poster.svg\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\">
      <div class=\"hero__top\">
        <p class=\"hero__intro\">An independent film practice.</p>
        <span class=\"frame-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>
      </div>
      <div class=\"hero__bottom\">
        <div class=\"hero__composition\">
          <h1 id=\"hero-title\">A quiet <span>study.</span></h1>
          <a class=\"explore\" href=\"#work\">
            <span>Explore</span>
            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5l14 14M5 19h14V5\"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class=\"hero__caption\">Static poster · Footage not supplied</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class=\"work\" id=\"work\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">
      <div class=\"work__heading\">
        <span class=\"work__index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span>
        <h2 id=\"work-title\">Selected work</h2>
      </div>
      <p class=\"work__note\">The supplied poster is shown above. Film footage has not been supplied; video playback is unavailable in this version.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
EOF
cat > NOTES.md <<'EOF'
# Authoring notes

- Built "'`index.html` as a standalone static page. Preserved the requested heading, body, square Explore link to `#work`, and Selected work heading.
- Read the selected local frontend skill and relevant brief, direction, implementation, restrained, cinematic, and media references. Selected R4-style framing/text protection for the static poster; no video lifecycle or motion.
- Parameters: teal/cream palette, system sans + Georgia, square 120px CTA (96px narrow), 600px mobile breakpoint, poster cover at 75% center, dark text-protection gradients. No dependencies, scripts, generated media, or external requests.
- `assets/poster.svg` is the verified local synthetic fixture; rights recorded in `assets/rights.json`. That record names `scene.webm`, but no footage file is present. No video URL or playback controls were invented. Visible copy states the limitation; solid teal remains if the image fails.
- Small shell content check passed for required copy, local poster, anchor target, square CTA rules, and absence of video/external sources. Browser/runtime, responsive rendering, keyboard behavior, contrast, and playback remain unverified; central observer owns qualification. No browser, server, installation, or second verification workflow was run.
EOF
python3 - <<'"'PY'
from pathlib import Path
import re
page = Path('index.html').read_text()
text = re.sub(r'<["'^>]+>'"', '', page)
assert 'A quiet study.' in re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', text)
for copy in ['An independent film practice.', 'Selected work', 'Explore']:
    assert copy in page
assert 'href=\"#work\"' in page and 'id=\"work\"' in page
assert 'src=\"assets/poster.svg\"' in page and Path('assets/poster.svg').is_file()
assert 'width: 7.5rem;' in page and 'height: 7.5rem;' in page and 'border-radius: 0;' in page
assert not re.search(r'<(?:video|script)\\b|https?://', page)
assert 'Footage not supplied' in page
print('PASS: required content, poster, anchor, square CTA, static-only sources.')
PY"
